<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off mostly $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off mostly $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 lower. Demand was light. Top $49.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 48.00-49.00, few 47.50 and 49.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  40.00-44.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs.  44.00-47.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs.  47.00-50.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs.  49.00-51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
